Scope of this port license

This license covers this project's original Java adaptation host, launcher
modifications, display helper, controller configuration, build and verification
tools, tests, handwritten compile-only declarations and original documentation.
Port maintained by Pixelforge ports (Ronax).

Launcher portions adapted from BinaryCounter's Westonpack libGDX example retain
the upstream MIT notice below. It applies to the adapted example code, not all
components of the separately provided Westonpack runtime.

Residual game code, artwork, screenshots and trademarks are not licensed by this
MIT grant. Third-party library/runtime code retains its own terms. This license
covers only this project's original contributions to compile-only declarations,
not ownership of the game's underlying interfaces or implementation.

